 "description": "This dataset is an ArcGIS Shapefile representing areas that Planning &amp; Zoning has determined to be Stormwater Draininage Problem Areas for use in the Minor Subdivision Review Process. The specific area's were identified by Roger Blaylock, County Engineer, Road &amp; Bridge Foreman for each Commission District, and data received from Roads &amp; Bridges during the April 2006 100 Year Flood Event. The Digital DFRIM was appended to the layer to replace FEMA Q3 data in April 2009.",
